---
description: Respect ChefPro module boundaries and layering
alwaysApply: true
---

# Architecture Boundaries

- `src/modules` contains domain logic and should not import UI components.
- `src/app` and `src/components` are presentation/API layers and should call into modules/lib.
- `src/lib` hosts cross-cutting infrastructure (auth, db, validation, utilities).
- Keep cross-module interactions explicit through service boundaries/events.

# Implementation Guidance

- Add new business rules in module services/types, not in page components.
- Keep API route handlers thin: validate input, call service, map output.
- Avoid circular dependencies between module folders.
